--- interpretation (honest bounds) ---
mode is uncapped (no vsync, no targetFrameRate): numbers are a throughput ceiling, not
display-capped fps. Charter "avg >= 30fps" passes under any reading (render avg 608.5).
fps_min 5.16/5.25 comes from exactly one ~190ms frame per phase (dt_max 193.7/190.5ms at
phase transition / first render), all other frames p95 <= 2.147ms.

--- root cause fixed this round ---
First run (18:05) hung: play-mode entry performed a domain reload (project setting
m_EnterPlayModeOptionsEnabled=0), wiping the static state and the EditorApplication.update
subscription, so the probe never ticked again. Fix: temporarily set
EditorSettings.enterPlayModeOptionsEnabled=true + DisableDomainReload in BatchEntry and
restore the previous values in Finish/Fail. Post-run project settings verified back to
m_EnterPlayModeOptionsEnabled=0 / m_EnterPlayModeOptions=3.

Full editor log is gitignored (City3D-staging/r2-soak.log, 60KB+); this excerpt plus the
raw JSON are the committed evidence.